            "description": {
              "value": "Dark thunderclouds swirl in a miniature storm, crisscrossed with lightning bolts; a tremendous thunderclap fills the air. The storm appears in a 20-foot burst within 60 feet. Each creature in the area takes 3d12 electricity damage and 1d10 sonic damage, with a basic Reflex save against your class DC. A creature that fails its save is deafened until the end of its next turn (or for 1 minute on a critical failure). A creature wearing metal armor or made of metal takes a –1 circumstance penalty to its save."
